## CFD Analysis

**Geometry:** box (2D), L=3m × W=2m
**Fluid:** water (ν=1.00e-06 m²/s, ρ=1e+03 kg/m³)
**Re = 5e+04** → turbulent regime
**Solver:** interFoam (transient, multiphase VOF)
**Turbulence:** laminar — no turbulence model (laminar)
**Simulation score:** 0.85 (converged=True)
**Notes:** OK | Tall water column dam break. interFoam, high Re VOF.

## OpenFOAM Case Files

### system/controlDict
```
/*--------------------------------*- C++ -*----------------------------------*\
| =========                 |                                                 |
| \      /  F ield         | OpenFOAM: The Open Source CFD Toolbox           |
